This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you use the Capsule mobile app.
1. Information We Collect
 Account Information: Name, email address, username, and password created during sign-up.
 Vault Content: Photos, videos, audio notes, and text predictions you upload to a vault. Content remains encrypted until the vault's designated unlock date.
 Device & Usage Data: Basic technical data, including device model, operating system version, and IP address to ensure app stability and performance.
2. How We Use Your Information
 Vault Delivery: Store and lock your content until the selected reveal date.
 Account Management: Authenticate your login, reset passwords, and send notifications when a vault unlocks.
 App Improvement: Monitor performance, fix bugs, and enhance security.
3. Content Privacy & Access
 Blind Storage: Locked vault content is restricted from view within the app—including by other vault members—until the designated unlock date.
 No Selling of Data: We do not sell your personal data or vault content to third parties, advertisers, or data brokers.
4. Data Sharing
We only share information with trusted third-party service providers (such as secure cloud storage and database hosts) strictly necessary to run the app, or if required by law.
5. Data Retention & Deletion
 Vault content is retained until the vault unlocks and is either archived or deleted by the vault owner.
 You may request account and data deletion at any time by navigating to Account Settings > Delete Account in the app.
6. Children's Privacy
Capsule is intended for users aged 13 and older. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13.

